before:
Complete local Go example; the app itself does not execute it:
```go
package main

import (
	"fmt"
)

func main() {
	original := [3]int{2, 4, 6}
	copy := original
	copy[0] = 9
	fmt.Println(original[0], copy[0])
}

```

